+	   strikes/misheard/flags) — a struck self-correction reads literally
+	   struck through, right where it was said; "misheard" is a quiet aside;
+	   a flag uses `--error`, the one red this site already has, so it reads
+	   as "needs your eyes" without a second colour to learn. */
+	.refine-modes-clean-sentence { margin-block-end: 0.3em; }
+	.refine-modes-strike { color: var(--subtle); margin-inline-end: 0.4em; }
